      "text": "SILK ROAD AND MEDIEVAL (1200–1450)\n  ────────────────────────────────────\n  Ibn Battuta (1304–1368/9): 120,000 km across the Islamic world\n  Marco Polo (1254–1324): Venice to China, 24 years away\n  Zheng He (1371–1433): 7 voyages, Indian Ocean; largest fleet of the era\n  Rabban Sauma (1220–1294): Mongol monk to Rome — east-west reverse journey"
    },
    {
