        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Explorers - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "AGE OF EXPLORATION (1415–1520)\n  ────────────────────────────────\n  Portuguese: coast of Africa, Cape route to India\n    Dias (1488): Cape of Good Hope\n    da Gama (1498): India via Cape\n  Spanish: transatlantic\n    Columbus (1492): Caribbean (not knowing what he'd found)\n    Vespucci (1499–1502): recognized it as a new continent\n    Cabot (1497): North America (for England)"
    },
    {
