        "title": "Explorers - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CIRCUMNAVIGATION ERA (1519–1600)\n  ─────────────────────────────────\n  Magellan+Elcano (1519–1522): first circumnavigation (Magellan died; Elcano completed)\n  Drake (1577–1580): second circumnavigation; first to command the complete voyage\n  Anson (1740–1744): survival circumnavigation (only 188 of 1,900 survived)"
    },
    {
