      "text": "PACIFIC EXPLORATION (1600–1800)\n  ─────────────────────────────────\n  Tasman (1642–43): New Zealand, Tasmania, Tonga, Fiji\n  Bougainville (1766–69): first French circumnavigation\n  Cook (1768–1779): three voyages; most systematically documented\n  Vancouver (1791–95): Pacific Northwest coast survey"
    },
