      "text": "SCIENTIFIC EXPEDITIONS (1800–1870)\n  ────────────────────────────────────\n  Humboldt (1799–1804): South America; systematic scientific measurement\n  Darwin (1831–36): Beagle; Galapagos; evolutionary theory origin\n  Wallace (1854–62): Malay Archipelago; parallel evolutionary theory\n  Challenger expedition (1872–76): deep sea oceanography"
    },
