      "text": "CONTINENTAL INTERIORS (1800–1875)\n  ────────────────────────────────────\n  Lewis+Clark (1804–06): Missouri to Pacific; US corps of discovery\n  Livingstone+Stanley (Africa, 1840s–70s)\n  Burke+Wills (1860–61): Australia coast-to-coast; both died"
    },
