      "text": "POLAR EXPLORATION (1845–1922)\n  ──────────────────────────────\n  Franklin (1845–48): Northwest Passage; 129 men lost\n  Nansen (1893–96): deliberate drift across Arctic Ocean\n  Amundsen (1910–12): South Pole first; also first NW Passage\n  Scott (1910–12): South Pole second; all died returning\n  Shackleton (1914–16): ship lost in ice; all 28 men survived"
    },
