      "text": "VERTICAL FRONTIERS (1900–1970)\n  ────────────────────────────────\n  Mallory+Irvine (1924): Everest attempt; disappeared near summit\n  Herzog+Lachenal (1950): Annapurna; first 8000m peak\n  Hillary+Tenzing (1953): Everest summit\n  Messner (1978–1986): all 14 eight-thousanders; first solo Everest"
