      "text": "MODERN FRONTIERS (1957–present)\n  ─────────────────────────────────\n  Gagarin (1961): first human in space\n  Armstrong+Aldrin (1969): Moon landing\n  Cousteau (1950s–90s): undersea exploration; Calypso expeditions\n  Ballard (1985): Titanic discovered; deep-sea ROV exploration\n  Piccard (1999, 2012): stratosphere balloon; deepest ocean submersible\n```"
