      "text": "```\n  TYPE A: COMMERCIAL (trade route seeking)\n  ─────────────────────────────────────────\n  Columbus, da Gama, Cabot, Magellan.\n  Sponsors want trade routes, not discoveries.\n  The \"discovery\" was often incidental."
    },
