      "text": "TYPE B: IMPERIAL (sovereignty and mapping)\n  ───────────────────────────────────────────\n  Cook, Vancouver, Lewis+Clark.\n  State-sponsored. Map and claim.\n  Scientific observation a secondary goal."
    },
