      "text": "**\"Columbus discovered America.\"**\nColumbus reached the Caribbean (1492) and never recognized he was not in Asia. Norse explorers (Leif Eriksson) reached Newfoundland ~1000 CE. Indigenous peoples had inhabited the Americas for ~15,000+ years. The term \"discovery\" reflects European-centric framing."
